@prefix gmeow:   <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/epistemics>
    a gmeow:Slice ;
    rdfs:label "epistemics"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The epistemics slice of the GMEOW ontology (core tier): GMEOW Epistemics Module — propositional epistemic relations (belief, doubt, suspension, pragmatic acceptance, non-factive knowledge-that, and locally-factive knowledge-in-a-world), plus the factored five-way justification split (available-evidence, basing, support-under-a-standard, adequacy, defeat) over DoxasticStates and StandpointClaims. Anatomy, dependencies, and consumer are declared in this manifest; the manifest is the sole source of slice identity and tier."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/epistemics> ;
    dcterms:title "GMEOW Epistemics Module"@x-gmeow-english ;
    dcterms:creator "Blackcat Informatics® Inc." ;
    gmeow:sliceTier gmeow:tierCore ;
    gmeow:sliceDependsOn
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/kernel> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/temporal> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/observations> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/events> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/provenance> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/evidence> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/attestation> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/inference> ,
        <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/names> ;
    gmeow:sliceConsumer "The agent-memory flagship store_claim / recall MCP surface (Principle 14): an LLM output is a held attitude toward a proposition, recorded via the flat doxastic spine; the keystone knowsThat subPropertyOf believes materialises belief from any knowledge claim. The reified tier (DoxasticState, credence, doxasticClaim, DoxasticTenure) lives in this slice, reusing temporal:TimeScopedRelation/duringInterval and standpoint:StandpointClaim/claimModality. Justification is factored five ways (gmeow:hasAvailableEvidence / gmeow:basesBeliefOn / gmeow:supportsUnder / gmeow:adequateUnder / gmeow:defeatedBy + gmeow:hasDefeatStatus) over DoxasticStates and StandpointClaims; full inferential argumentation remains in the inference slice."@x-gmeow-english .
